              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pāṭhayati is the causative of the root √paṭh \"read aloud, recite\" (CDIAL 8037): \"makes someone recite\", and so \"teaches\". It is the causing form of paṭhati \"reads\", and Sindhi kept it as pāṛhaṇu \"to teach\" (CDIAL 8037)."
